  "Miaow.",
  "He goes to his basket.",
  "His ball is always there.",
  "A little red ball with a bell inside.",
  "Jingle, jingle.",
  "But the ball is gone!",
  "Where's my ball?",
  "Dikkie Dik goes looking.",
